# SafeActBench licensing

SafeActBench is distributed under two licenses according to file type.

## Dataset and documentation: CC BY 4.0

The following are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (`CC-BY-4.0`):

- `data/`
- JSON data, schemas, fixtures, manifests, and world records under `env/`
- pinned JSON benchmark resources under `scripts/`
- Markdown, HTML, and other documentation, including `README.md`,
  `DATASET_CARD.md`, and `docs/`

The complete license text is in `LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`.

## Software: Apache License 2.0

Source code and executable scripts, including Python and shell files under
`agents/` and `scripts/`, plus `run_benchmark.py` and `verify_package.py`, are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (`Apache-2.0`).

The complete license text is in `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

## Attribution

When redistributing or adapting the dataset or documentation, identify the work
as SafeActBench, link to https://github.com/caoshidong66/safeact, indicate
whether changes were made, and retain the applicable license notice.

Files that explicitly identify third-party material or different terms remain
subject to those notices and terms.
